    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 🔌 Webhook URL\n\nПрописать в:\n- Python TG-боте (вместо прямого вызова amoCRM/TG)\n- PHP-сайте\n\n**Поля JSON:**\n```\n{\n  \"source\": \"tg_bot\" | \"php_site\",\n  \"name\": \"Иван Иванов\",\n  \"phone\": \"+7 900 000-00-00\",\n  \"comment\": \"текст заявки\",\n  \"username\": \"@ivan\" (опц.),\n  \"utm\": {} (опц.)\n}\n```",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "e27a4e24-1a92-46cf-9bf9-c172a8e6a25e",
      "name": "📌 Webhook Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1728,
        -320
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "name": "amocrm_subdomain",
              "value": "your-company",
              "type": "string"
            },
